# graphify knowledge graph.
# Track the queryable DB (graph.json), human-readable analysis (GRAPH_REPORT.md),
# and manifest so the graph is consistent across clones. The interactive viz
# (graph.html) is large and regenerable, and local state is machine-specific.
graphify-out/graph.html
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/cost.json
graphify-out/.graphify_python
graphify-out/.graphify_root
graphify-out/.graphify_*.json
graphify-out/.needs_update
# dated rollback backups created by the auto-rebuild hook
graphify-out/20*/
